                                                "sense_id": "802ca4b6-4b32-3cd3-82da-8e0105e5d1d5",
                                                "text": "The White House denied today that it would conduct quiet “shuttle diplomacy” with Chinese diplomats at the United Nations on matters directly involving Washington and Peking."
